# Bug 1: "not between A and B" violates De Morgan's Law in parser.py:1108
# Expands "not between 18 and 30" -> "not >= 18 and <= 30" -> "age < 18 and age <= 30"
# Drops everyone with age > 30!

Members is a collection.
Each member has a name (text) and an age (number).

add-member: add a member.
# Buggy phrasing (compiles, but misses age > 30!):
buggy-outside: show the name of members whose age is not between 18 and 30.
# Correct workaround phrasing:
correct-outside: show the name of members whose age is under 18 or over 30.
